### WorthTheCredit API — manual requests
# Use with VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client: click "Send Request".
# Local dev: set DEV_AUTH_BYPASS=true in .env, then any token below works:
#   "dev"            → verified user "dev|local-user"
#   "dev:alice"      → verified user "dev|alice" (pick any name for a second user)
#   "dev-unverified" → unverified user (POST /reviews → 403)
# With real Auth0: paste a real access token into @token (see README-BE2 §11).

@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = dev
@adminKey = local-admin-key

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Course search (BE1 stub) — public
GET {{base}}/courses?q=swen

### Course detail with stats (BE1 stub) — public
GET {{base}}/courses/SWEN-261

### Worth Score + stats — public
GET {{base}}/courses/SWEN-261/stats

### Public reviews, newest first (optional ?professor=&limit=&offset=) — public
GET {{base}}/courses/SWEN-261/reviews?limit=5&offset=0

### Filter reviews by professor — public
GET {{base}}/courses/SWEN-261/reviews?professor=dr.%20rivera

### Create a review → 201 (run twice → 409 already_reviewed)
POST {{base}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course_code": "CSCI-420",
  "goals": ["career_preparation", "skill_development"],
  "worth_score": 5,
  "skills": ["Pandas", "Clustering"],
  "difficulty": 4,
  "weekly_hours": "10-12",
  "feedback": "Real messy data; start homework early.",
  "professor": "Dr. Patel",
  "semester": "Fall 2025"
}

### Validation error → 422
POST {{base}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_code": "CSCI-420", "goals": [], "worth_score": 9, "skills": [], "difficulty": 0, "weekly_hours": "lots" }

### Unknown course → 404 course_not_found
POST {{base}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_code": "FAKE-999", "goals": ["career_preparation"], "worth_score": 3, "skills": ["x"], "difficulty": 3, "weekly_hours": "0-3" }

### Unverified email → 403 email_not_verified
POST {{base}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer dev-unverified
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_code": "PSYC-101", "goals": ["personal_exploration"], "worth_score": 4, "skills": ["Empathy"], "difficulty": 2, "weekly_hours": "4-6" }

### Missing token → 401 not_authenticated
POST {{base}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Have I reviewed this course?
GET {{base}}/reviews/me?course_code=CSCI-420
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report a review (paste an id from the public list) → 201; again → 409 already_reported
# Reasons: spam | fake | inappropriate | off_topic | other
POST {{base}}/reviews/REPLACE-WITH-REVIEW-ID/report
Authorization: Bearer dev:reporter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "spam", "note": "Looks like an ad" }

### Admin: hide a review (excluded from lists and stats)
POST {{base}}/admin/reviews/REPLACE-WITH-REVIEW-ID/hide
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Admin: unhide
POST {{base}}/admin/reviews/REPLACE-WITH-REVIEW-ID/unhide
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Profile: get (404 profile_not_found at first)
GET {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Profile: save
PUT {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "major": "Software Engineering",
  "interests": ["machine learning", "data"],
  "skills": ["Python"],
  "career_goals": "ML engineer in healthcare",
  "personal_interests": ["public speaking"],
  "degree_requirements": "One CS advanced elective"
}

### Recommendations with an explicit profile + request
POST {{base}}/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile": { "major": "Software Engineering", "interests": ["machine learning", "data"], "career_goals": "ML engineer" },
  "query": "I want something hands-on with ML that isn't too heavy a workload."
}

### Recommendations using the SAVED profile (omit "profile")
POST {{base}}/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "hands-on data projects" }
